# ── GPU hunt subsystem (kept local only, out of git) ──
# All gpu_hunt sources live under E:\VC\SAO-UI\GPU_hunt\ outside this repo.
# These patterns are a belt-and-braces defence against re-introducing any
# gpu_hunt file into the sao_auto tree by accident (agent WIP, IDE moves,
# stale checkout, etc.).
